      "videoPrompt": "blue light dots gently pulse and spread outward from air molecules while white beam enters"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "characterIds": [],
      "visual": "垂直剖面图：上部为太空深蓝，中部为淡蓝大气层，含均匀分布的透明小球（空气分子）；白光入射后，短波蓝光剧烈散射呈扇形扩散，长波红光几乎直行",
      "camera": "medium close-up, centered on atmospheric layer",
      "dialogue": {
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "空气分子对光的散射遵循瑞利定律——波长越短，散射越强。"
      },
      "durationSec": 10,
      "imagePrompt": "flat illustration, 9:16 aspect ratio, vertical cross-section of Earth's atmosphere: top is dark space blue, middle is soft sky-blue band filled with evenly spaced tiny transparent spheres (air molecules), a white sunlight ray enters from top center, splitting visually into strong fan-shaped blue scatter pattern and faint straight red/yellow rays passing through, labeled 'λ short → strong scatter' and 'λ long → weak scatter' in small sans-serif font, clean infographic style, mint and azure color scheme",
      "videoPrompt": "blue scatter fan expands smoothly while red light rays remain steady and linear"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "s2",
      "characterIds": [],
      "visual": "同一剖面图，但阳光以极低角度斜穿更厚大气层，路径上更多空气分子，蓝光几乎全部散射殆尽，只剩红橙光抵达观察者视线",
      "camera": "same framing, slight zoom-in on light path",
      "dialogue": {
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "傍晚时，阳光斜穿更厚的大气，蓝光被反复散射到别处，剩下红光直达我们眼睛。"
      },
      "durationSec": 12,
      "imagePrompt": "flat illustration, 9:16 aspect ratio, same vertical atmospheric cross-section as previous shot but sunlight ray now enters at shallow angle from top-right, traveling longer path through dense lower atmosphere filled with more transparent spheres, almost no blue light reaches bottom — only warm red-orange ray reaches viewer position at base, scattered blue dots concentrated far above and sideways, subtle glow effect on red ray, clean infographic style, coral and lavender accents",
      "videoPrompt": "red-orange ray glows steadily while blue scatter points fade outward along extended path"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "s3",
      "characterIds": [],
      "visual": "简洁地平线构图：左侧地面剪影，右侧巨大暖色夕阳，天空由橙渐变至紫，上方残留少量高散射蓝光粒子",
      "camera": "wide shot, static",
      "dialogue": {
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "所以——天空蓝，因为蓝光爱‘乱跑’；夕阳红，因为蓝光已被‘送走’。"
      },
      "durationSec": 9,
      "imagePrompt": "flat illustration, 9:16 aspect ratio, horizon line divides composition: bottom third is dark silhouetted land, top two-thirds show gradient sky from peach-orange near sunset to soft violet upward, large glowing orange-red sun on right edge, sparse tiny blue light dots visible only in upper sky region, no text, serene and balanced composition, airy pastel palette",
      "videoPrompt": "sunset glows softly while faint blue dots shimmer subtly in upper sky"
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "s1",
      "characterIds": [],
      "visual": "回归蓝天画面，中央浮现半透明文字框：‘瑞利散射 × 波长反比’，背景蓝光粒子微微浮动",
      "camera": "close-up on center, gentle scale pulse",
      "dialogue": {
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "这就是瑞利散射的魔力。"
      },
      "durationSec": 8,
      "imagePrompt": "flat illustration, 9:16 aspect ratio, same light blue sky background as first shot, soft floating blue light particles throughout, centered semi-transparent white rounded rectangle containing clean text '瑞利散射 ∝ 1/λ⁴' in modern sans-serif, no shadow, gentle ambient glow, mint and sky-blue color scheme, infographic clarity",
      "videoPrompt": "text box pulses gently once while blue particles drift slowly"
    }
  ]
}

